    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d447-a1">

                <pb facs="0828" n="724" sameAs="frus:frus1943CairoTehran/pg724"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">annex</hi></head>
                <p rendition="#flush">To: SACSEA</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">From: Mideast</p>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">most immediate</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">clear the line</hi></p>
                <p>Following for Admiral Mountbatten from Combined Chiefs of Staff.</p>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>If, as a result of <hi rendition="#small-caps">Eureka</hi> Conference
                        overriding priority were to be given to European operations, this would make
                        it necessary to withdraw bulk of your landing craft and assault shipping
                        during the next few weeks.</item>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>This would rule out <hi rendition="#small-caps">Buccaneer</hi> as at
                        present planned before the monsoon, but the necessity would remain to stage,
                        in conjunction with <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tarzan</hi>, amphibious
                        operations on a smaller scale, possibly of a hit-and-run nature involving
                        carrier raids and landings of commandos.</item>
                    <pb facs="0829" n="725" xml:id="pg725"/>
                    <label>3.</label>
                    <item>Do you consider operations of this kind feasible? If so, telegraph
                        urgently flash estimate of resources you would require.</item>
                    <label>4.</label>
                    <item>Your reply must be received by 1600 G. M. T. 6th December.<anchor n="16"
                            xml:id="d447-f1"/></item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
